            <div class="content content-block text">
                <div data-aa-icon-list="icon-list not set" class=" ">
                    <h5><b>Need Help Now?</b></h5>
<p>If you are in immediate need of help, please <b><a href="/find-your-local-chapter.html" target="Target" rel="noopener noreferrer">contact your local Red Cross »</a> </b>or <a href="/get-help/disaster-relief-and-recovery-services/find-an-open-shelter.html" target="Target" rel="noopener noreferrer"><b>find an open shelter »</b></a></p>

